===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|магази́нъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|de|Magazin}} or {{bor|ru|nl|magazijn}}, from {{der|ru|frm|magasin||warehouse, store}}, from {{der|ru|it|magazzino||storehouse}}, from {{der|ru|ar|مَخَازِن||storerooms, storehouses}}.

The informal stress variant {{m|ru||мага́зин}} is possibly via {{der|ru|pl|magazyn}}.

{{sense|ammunition clip or chamber}} Compare natively formed {{m+|cs|zásobník}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|магази́н}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-магазин.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|in|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|магази́н|adj=магази́нный|dim=магази́нчик|clip=мага́з}}

# {{topics|ru|Shops}} [[shop]], [[store]] {{gl|establishment that sells goods}}
# {{topics|ru|Weapons}} [[magazine]] {{gl|ammunition holder enabling multiple rounds of ammunition to be fed to a gun}}
# [[honey]] [[storehouse]]/[[storeroom]]
# [[hopper]], [[dispenser]], [[stacker]]
# {{lb|ru|dated}} [[warehouse]]

